            follow from the triangulator coherence conditions. (Warning: it is not generally true that a lax adjunction induces an adjoint pair in
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
